"Brox's black-bladed sword, the concept of destruction made physical, can only chip adamant."
"Later, Aarl cuts through Sussu's adamant vault wall with Brox's black sword."
"The Syncarius-killing adamantium dagger weaves wizardry between both planes; it is indestructible."
"The Aleph Grid treasured that dagger; it mattered that Sussu, not the Aleph Grid, held it last."
"Later, the dagger is the only item Nathan can hold without breaking it."
"Later, the dagger survives a blightmind unblemished, then crumbles after its final use."
"Later, prolonged antimagic severs wizardry from adamantium and leaves grey dust."
"Even adamantium blades can chip and shatter against Nathan's body later on."
